      "uid": "zhcn:a8c09e0e4da5e22c71f8e7b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天感觉能睡得超香～！\r\n生野真的很强壮耶。\r\n我跟她跑到超越极限都没力了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c37017a9ef5997b30192b66e581297d8f27205b8b70acce33427371b847bbbe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:025f3bb927f4bc4d127bd1ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新生在哪里！？我想加LANE！\r\n还是干脆从顶楼把我的ID\r\n往楼下撒……不行吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ad28bab2bcc760b2dabd426a30554389818d77267f6f734ff7eae416cbd0560",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab75c7e07db65206dc2db33c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好耶！属于我的季节到了～！\r\n总之先全部嗨一波。\r\n要去海边也要去山上……超嗨！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "14f591e57e24ead943ecd603e95314c95a28bdc8aca7bf67ee6cad8be17bae59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b237815e43b0b7f43069ab4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员～～大事不妙！！\r\n秋天的新商品全都太好吃了！！\r\n唔哇～会肥死～算了没差吧～",
      "source_fingerprint": "9608e5b3b29232a8e34bef29b30dbf39067ac54b89ba6df94be1eed5c4c7c90c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e577bc894974222fadcfba4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊！我必须去找奇迹！\r\n冬天她会冻得像冰块，很可怜～\r\n火热的我要负责抱她♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "53517bd906eb467b6fadd7094ddb9d436114f9cba670cf129b0ac617c9188278",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:077e78f6223437c44c8c9af8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "とれぽよ☆おはぽよ☆ガチぽよ～！\r\nとりま朝イチ踊らん？的なチェケ☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c86f280180bd5d17a1abbb3d37f150050bb1b06cf7cf86db52ce955681403d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a15f01ae4993da6509028e77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まだ眠いマ！？\r\nあ、顔ガチったら目覚めんじゃん？\r\nりょ！ギャルメってあげゆ☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "b64d8a432dc6d04db0b4f2a3d126bda378bff78a058bbd70ea630b503ac0960e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1324a8c3c4ae6c43c95a5a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふわ～あふ…。\r\nやび。バカデカあくびった。\r\n…お嬢にはナイチョね？",
      "source_fingerprint": "76bb266e9907716d62b83f62d961ce8630260e1c4a8537be9792dc3bf4ee982f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51722d830c5aa0aab97bf1b2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "うぇいうぇいハロぴ～！\r\nもう飯った？まだならトゥゲ希望☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fe6330206630f1251363f56977fc14187b00afa49338bca6d0529b813b43b13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe66827cce2c9f46df12057f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夜になるのマジ秒！\r\nしょーみ踊り足りえんてぃ～。\r\n…ちら。",
      "source_fingerprint": "97d6aa565af39a3ae19558a28f01e4529666c67735713a532cd9cdd4ec3db0a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc55d28fe3a01c273ef1e4c4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレぴおか＆おつー！\r\nこの時間までとかマジえら！\r\n偉すぎ謙信！よすよすザウルス☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "14a23a249fdd7deeee945687bdc7ce517b814918c52623d7b335a5d00bb9274a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d12949189bdfaf633866f517",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ドロワシーズンきちゃ！\r\n…ってことで、ト・レ・ぴ♡\r\n今日はウチと“デート”…しよ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "380ab1b7a01352e6304890dc22f17e3a08561c06bd70a2a377d45295444e1084",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07a3e8f4c52ddaa5deb74852",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏withウチ☆\r\nどどどどどーすんの？\r\nフェスすんべー☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7ef2035a951c1701908ddf1efea7d501cd90f3b335c46adb6d3cfc4a581b96c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea533868b4784e4daa3f950e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この服マジデブれん！\r\nワンチャン太ももガチハムる！\r\n…ケド秋は一旦ギブで！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7662c81668c4f2a273e460cf9714d265e2c3214912202874c070891632358268",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c28c9963c516f3876c9ff72b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヤバ！今日エグ寒くね！？\r\nムリムリザウルス！絶滅しゅる！\r\nプリズちゃんヘリ、温もりてぃ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef56d4afe9928a6acab36f2ae791b9eacfbfa28f547f68befe7bf5dfb1fd62d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4143fc110ee427bd484c6b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49ca4eb2b52dac0ea05c30ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハッピーバレンタイン！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce6d8d9eca19623907ad62c3fee5b746e2a7886cd999191715aceca42bf64b29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdcf9a553613e28477c17421",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "善信不是很喜欢我吗？\r\n甚至可以说是爱了吧？\r\n那已经不是嗨不嗨的问题了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec1c8c48c71329f5ed3950a31f45c0742e0f08f77a97d55a02cc993a2ded2d65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9273632256c7bcef0ecd9765",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "红宝石给人一种「大小姐！」的感觉，\r\n超级可爱的。即使她是高岭之花，\r\n我有天也会用超强跳跃抓住她～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ba95814fc835c76c5095f79b8a68c27fb4041c577c9651ce46dfd3ca65ea2f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:954fa3056b3b7cda77cf74e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听我说！我的LANE好友数\r\n又快到上限了！\r\n看来只能升级成官方账号了～！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc26ae99267fafaa9e711561d0a6ef7f32fe6c1be3edaa40092ddd00bb1069fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b7ff5a0ab4e249a204a1ea1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小矢真的很夸张耶！\r\n她之前……啊，小矢是我的阿姨！\r\n她这个人真的很不得了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "690d2788c33779f3e7903fa717ebd88c5657f1253d14a136de554c8266a2415e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16c1a6a8bf4d4f17d6699a4b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "佐敦真的很搞笑！\r\n她之前鞋跟断掉时，居然想用\r\n朋友的双眼皮胶水黏起来～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd6fe6daec5b229326e6eafc1e0788acad75c887249e06b0f010143707e0c395",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dcc9490e665e67ebaff7d7af",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家很难得像这样都一样吧！？\r\n这一定要拍一张照！！\r\n训练员，叫大家集合～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "82754d85f1f11f8943fc23c0d841668f132d8f85aa79f10b613e31f75620dcaf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52822d0047ca470d1490d442",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "设计师真是内行！\r\n肚脐就是要露出来才行☆\r\n因为里面充满了爱与和平！",
      "source_fingerprint": "41fb751b7320be249b456f7da2e344e14699922398934850bb47aac4b6cff7a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a17b3bdf871a7e3ad85ecc4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不想舍弃街头感，\r\n但该有的亮点还是不能少。\r\n所以有种大改造的感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ee1fa66b5f63ec4099ee25f72710775df6c27c1762ff0358b9b8acb1da05b41",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95a5a472a11cd2ad4e97ecbc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我本来打扮得更华丽，\r\n但被老师吐槽说「你是镜球啊！」\r\n让我笑到放弃了☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce3fd2159a8ff1bda647de5bbb4a794749c6d7b5df2da1319758231defbe3761",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:876b1b6ccfae8790106073ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯，计划？我都要看心情耶！\r\n总之看起来有趣的全都试试，\r\n凭感觉嗨起来就是我的计划☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ab53b9f95fa9839c1a17a44ba966335c2fa9c1aeb95a60e0d4e271bcaeeb38a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6866054fbe67f30f65094e48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不妙！又忘记吃饭了！\r\n跟涡轮一起嗨过头～！干脆\r\n跟她组成DJ&表演者搭档吧！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac54d49157f44a9d6bbe1add4e10b75aaa4e7fe9065daceecdf8500f0459fa0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca2896fd26ba6b019cfe43a8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的梦话已经跟醒着说话差不多了。\r\n而且会笑还会唱歌未免太嗨了吧？\r\n真喜欢我自己☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba1b796bfdc6b1cf891596bf8a2ac80c06a42a27a9242d478c3d9dab27737e68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd256510d6257d4e9f60a02c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸～要怎么调查花的名字呀？\r\n我刚才看到一种颜色超深的红花～\r\n很有大小姐的感觉！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6696bd81522d882576f9ce6cf927d11c4f7431a6122ccd1d7b79bc18336819c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45afbcf1ad763ff8096a336b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿，我又买新泳装了☆\r\n不过没关系吧！因为我真的超爱去\r\n海边的！最好每次去都穿不一样♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4aba883857261ee7ab21d3d9c058ab60376f4d3636febb1407727a2738ac914a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72167a6fa0be36edb3a73b47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我要用小花儿收集的落叶烤番薯！\r\n进进王也来客串☆\r\n我们要让火焰直冲天空～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6cfec28abaffcf302d12e6c047843c71e6ea2fdab72013cee04835545a86222",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6152a369d3cf10dc74029a67",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也收到挑战书了──！\r\n跟青竹的打雪仗祭典超热血～！\r\n我和善信组成的神搭档绝对要赢☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "eacbc8328b853a99f8d6b09547851a5ff802163fe146bbf1c874ccf7999e654a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ab9e4fc78f47422c621d75c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ぴえん…部屋のミラボ…\r\n寮母たんにとらりた…。\r\nタピヘリハウスの宝が…おろろ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "71bac528ef49fa9fd8105abe82bfde145ce9ed0d963c8e5a0ef05469bc0babb4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:44722753b3eed777241278fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヤバイトレぴ…ウチのズッ友、\r\nダンス神んちゅかもしれん…。\r\nリード爆イケ。ガチ惚れる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aeca64c43ef2cf7d89749efec03d28395e27626dd53649ac9a0c4492b9c6195e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1065",
        "91017"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
